{"h":"cuadra-mens-boots-cu942rs-res-crust-castano-mn-chocolate","t":"Cuadra Men's Urban Ankle Boots (CU942/2T53RS - Chocolate)","b":"Cuadra","c":"Boots","d":"Details \n Men's urban ankle boot in genuine bovine leather. Features laser engraving and perforations. The side has PVC appliqu\u00e9s with a V-cut and the Cuadra logo. Fastens with an internal zipper. Includes the latest technologies: Ortholite insole, removable flex insole, and a soft-lined upper. Leather sole with a non-slip TPU insert.\n The product may differ from the photo due to natural variations in the leather. Any marks or scars present are not considered defects and demonstrate the authenticity of each product.\n Materials\n Bovine:\u00a0Bovine leather is renowned for its strength and versatility, making it ideal for a wide range of products. Its durability and classic appearance have made it a staple in both fashion and everyday items.\n Care\n Bovine leather needs regular care to stay durable.\n- Brush off any dust and dirt.\n- Clean with a damp cloth.\n- Apply a leather cream to keep the material hydrated.\n- Clean the soles with a brush and mild soap.\n- Polish the footwear with a soft cloth.\n- Store with shoe trees to maintain shape.","tags":["Men / Man / Hombre / Caballero"],"imgs":["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/2T53RS_CHOCO-res-crust-castano-bota-04_1080x1080_4d1b9c25-8889-4465-9d65-f3a816b92bdc.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/PV25_2T53RS_copia2_1080x1080_79696a29-1d72-4b46-ae4e-c3561e66158f.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/2T53RS_CHOCO-res-crust-castano-bota-01_1080x1080_8294aab7-8030-4a98-a680-5d6864b6ee29.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/2T53RS_CHOCO-res-crust-castano-bota-07_1080x1080_9c058dc9-b3b6-4523-aa84-695dc5f97794.jpg","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0466/0428/8151/files/2T53RS_CHOCO-res-crust-castano-bota-13_1080x1080_21dd0756-ed70-4627-8215-4998777f4f23.jpg","https:/